   "date": "2025-10-08",
   "url": "https://www.epw.senate.gov/public/_cache/files/a/e/aea43286-a650-4d68-8605-0009a29331d8/52075F495135A0D788B656FD2280D66C2615F58792B25098C05FE0C6F914A569.10.08.2025-nieh-testimony.pdf",
   "text": "Today, America’s demand for electricity is soaring—driven by artificial intelligence, data centers and economic growth. Nuclear energy is increasingly seen as a safe and reliable solution to help meet this demand.",
